<title>JAPAN: AT&amp;T to delist from TSE on June 29 - bourse.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T to delist from TSE on June 29 - bourse.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp  9489.T will be delisted from the Tokyo Stock Exchange on June 29 at its own request, the bourse said on Friday.</p>
</text>
